---------TurbSim v2.00.* Input File------------------------
IEA 15MW UMaineSemi — 150 m hub height, IEC Class B NTM, 11 m/s
---------Runtime Options-----------------------------------
False         Echo           - Echo input data to <RootName>.ech (flag)
         123  RandSeed1      - First random seed  (-2147483648 to 2147483647)
        1011  RandSeed2      - Second random seed (-2147483648 to 2147483647) for intrinsic pRNG, or an alternative pRNG: "RanLux" or "RNSNLW"
False         WrBHHTP        - Output hub-height turbulence parameters in binary form?  (Bladed-style .wnd file)
False         WrFHHTP        - Output hub-height turbulence parameters in formatted form?  (.dat file)
False         WrADHH         - Output hub-height time-series data in AeroDyn form?  (.hh file)
True          WrADFF         - Output full-field time-series data in TurbSim/AeroDyn form? (.bts file)
False         WrBLFF         - Output full-field time-series data in Bladed/AeroDyn form?  (.wnd file)
False         WrADTWR        - Output tower time-series data? (flag)
False         WrFMTFF        - Output full-field time-series data in formatted (text) form?  (.u, .v, .w files)
False         WrACT          - Output coherent turbulence time steps in AeroDyn form? (flag)
True          Clockwise      - Clockwise rotation looking downwind? (used only for full-field binary files - not used for AeroDyn)
         0   ScaleIEC       - Scale IEC turbulence models to exact target standard deviation? [0=no, 1=yes for WindType=2 only, 2=yes for all WindType s]
--------Turbine/Model Specifications-----------------------
        25   NumGrid_Z      - Vertical grid-point matrix dimension
        25   NumGrid_Y      - Horizontal grid-point matrix dimension
     0.050   TimeStep       - Time step [seconds]
       630   AnalysisTime   - Length of analysis time series [seconds] (program will add time if necessary: AnalysisTime = MAX(AnalysisTime, UsableTime+GridWidth/MeanHHWS) )
"ALL"        UsableTime     - Usable length of output time series [seconds] (program will add GridWidth/MeanHHWS seconds unless UsableTime is "ALL")
     150.0   HubHt          - Hub height [m] (should be > 0.5*GridHeight)
     260.0   GridHeight     - Grid height [m]
     260.0   GridWidth      - Grid width [m]  (should be >= 2*(RotorRadius+ShaftLength))
         0   VFlowAng       - Vertical mean flow (uptilt) angle [degrees]
         0   HFlowAng       - Horizontal mean flow (skew) angle [degrees]
--------Meteorological Boundary Conditions-------------------
"IECKAI"     TurbModel      - Turbulence model ("IECKAI","IECVKM","GP_LLJ","NWTCUP","SMOOTH", "WF_UPW","WF_07D","WF_14D","TIDAL","API","IECKAI2","TIMESR", or "NONE")
"1-ED3"      UserFile       - Name of the file that contains inputs for the user-defined spectra or time series inputs (ignored for other TurbModel values)
"1"          IECstandard    - Number of the IEC standard (61400-x, x=1,2,3) with optional 61400-1 edition number (e.g. "1-ED2")
"B"          IECturbc       - IEC turbulence characteristic ("A", "B", "C" or the turbulence intensity in percent) ("KHTEST" option with NWTCUP model, not used for other models)
"NTM"        IEC_WindType   - IEC turbulence type ("NTM"=normal, "xETM"=extreme turbulence, "xEWM1"=extreme 1-year wind, "xEWM50"=extreme 50-year wind, where x=wind turbine class 1, 2, or 3 ("EWMxxxx" options not available for Class 2)
"default"    ETMc           - IEC Extreme Turbulence Model "c" parameter [m/s]
"PL"         WindProfileType- Velocity profile type ("LOG";"PL"=power law;"JET";"H2L"=Log law for TIDAL model;"API";"USR";"TS";"IEC"=PL on rotor disk, LOG elsewhere; or "default")
"default"    ProfileFile    - Name of the file that contains input profiles for WindProfileType="USR" and/or TurbModel="USRVKM" [used only if WindProfileType="USR" or TurbModel="USRVKM"]
     150.0   RefHt          - Height of the reference velocity (URef) [m]
      11.0   URef           - Mean (total) velocity at the reference height [m/s] (or "default" for JET velocity profile)
"default"    ZJetMax        - Jet height [m] (used only for JET velocity profile, valid 70-490 m)
"default"    PLExp          - Power law exponent [-] (or "default")
"default"    Z0             - Surface roughness length [m] (or "default")
--------Non-IEC Meteorological Boundary Conditions----------
"default"    Latitude       - Site latitude [degrees] (or "default")
"default"    RICH_NO        - Gradient Richardson number [-] (or "default")
"default"    UStar          - Friction or shear velocity [m/s] (or "default")
"default"    ZI             - Mixing layer depth [m] (or "default")
"default"    PC_UW          - Hub-height u'w' Reynolds stress [(m/s)^2] (or "default" or "none")
"default"    PC_UV          - Hub-height u'v' Reynolds stress [(m/s)^2] (or "default" or "none")
"default"    PC_VW          - Hub-height v'w' Reynolds stress [(m/s)^2] (or "default" or "none")
--------Spatial Coherence Parameters------------------------
"default"    SCMod1         - u-component coherence model ("GENERAL", "IEC", "API", "NONE", or "default")
"default"    SCMod2         - v-component coherence model ("GENERAL", "IEC", "NONE", or "default")
"default"    SCMod3         - w-component coherence model ("GENERAL", "IEC", "NONE", or "default")
"default"    InCDec1        - u-component coherence parameters for general or IEC models [-, m^-1] (e.g. "10.0  0.3E-3" in quotes) (or "default")
"default"    InCDec2        - v-component coherence parameters for general or IEC models [-, m^-1] (e.g. "10.0  0.3E-3" in quotes) (or "default")
"default"    InCDec3        - w-component coherence parameters for general or IEC models [-, m^-1] (e.g. "10.0  0.3E-3" in quotes) (or "default")
"default"    CohExp         - Coherence exponent for general model [-] (or "default")
--------Coherent Turbulence Scaling Parameters-------------------
"path/to/coh_events/eventdata"  CTEventPath - Name of the path where event data files are located
"Random"     CTEventFile    - Type of event files ("Random", "List", or name of the event data file)
True         Randomize      - Randomize the disturbance scale and locations? (flag)
         1   DistScl        - Disturbance scale [-] (ratio of event dataset height to rotor disk. Used only when Randomize = false.)
       0.5   CTLy           - Fractional location of tower centerline from right (looking downwind) to left side of the dataset. (-) (Used only when Randomize = false.)
       0.5   CTLz           - Fractional location of hub height from the bottom of the dataset. (-) (Used only when Randomize = false.)
      30.0   CTStartTime    - Minimum start time for coherent structures in RootName.cts [seconds]
